  "details": "As per the title launching the beta version in steamVR causes it to crash once EAC has initialized and the actual VRC app has loaded. Running on desktop mode doesnt cause any issues but ever since build 1514 onwards trying to run VRC beta in VR mode will cause steamVR to crash, its somehow corrupting the steamvrsettings file found in the config folder of steam.\n\nDeleting or at least backing up and using a prior copy will fix the issue but trying to load VRC beta with the prior config file will still cause steamVR to crash\n\nIs this affecting any users? or has anyone found a fix?",
